                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-132",
                                    "linecount": 13,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 2731.25, 337.99997568130493, 150.0, 181.0 ],
                                    "text": "OUTPUT 5 — MAX COMMANDS\n\nMessages:\nclear_datasets\nconfigure <dataset_size>\ntrain <dataset_size>\nplay_gate 0/1\nrequest_new_bank\n\nControls dataset clearing, MLP configuration, training and PLAY mode."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-128",
                                    "linecount": 22,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 2568.75, 337.99997568130493, 150.0, 301.0 ],
                                    "text": "OUTPUT 4 — POINT IDENTIFIER\n\nSymbol:\npoint-<number>\n\nExamples:\npoint-1\npoint-32\npoint-50\n\nConnect to:\nt s s\n\nThen send the same ID to:\naddpoint $1 xybuf\naddpoint $1 knobparamsbuf\n\nTriggers the addition of the paired point to both datasets."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-123",
                                    "linecount": 15,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 2406.25, 337.99997568130493, 150.0, 208.0 ],
                                    "text": "OUTPUT 3 — POINT COORDINATES\n\nList:\n<xL> <yL> <xR> <yR>\n\nExample:\n0.3756 0. 0.6688 0.\n\nConnect to:\nfluid.list2buf @destination xybuf @autosize 0\n\nWrites the point coordinates into xybuf."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-121",
                                    "linecount": 14,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 2250.0, 337.99997568130493, 151.0, 194.0 ],
                                    "text": "OUTPUT 2 — PATTERN RECALL\n\nInteger:\n<pattern_id>\n\nExamples:\n1\n4\n12\n\nSends the pattern number to the Max preset recall system."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-119",
                                    "linecount": 52,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 2087.5, 337.99997568130493, 150.0, 704.0 ],
                                    "text": "OUTPUT 1 — JSUI EVENTS\n\nMessages:\nstate <state_name>\nmode auto/semi/free/play\nreduce_motion 0/1\nauto_points <count>\nquestionnaire_pattern <pattern_id> 12\nanswer_saved <pattern_id> <0/1>\nliked <pattern_ids>\nselected <pattern_ids>\nposition <xL> <yL> <xR> <yR>\npattern_loading <pattern_id>\npattern_ready <pattern_id>\nbatch_points <count>\nbatch_started <pattern_id> <count>\npoint_writing <pattern_id> <xL> <yL> <xR> <yR>\npoint_added <point_id> <pattern_id> <xL> <yL> <xR> <yR>\ndataset_points <dataset_size>\nbatch_progress <current> <total>\nbatch_finished <pattern_id> <total>\nmodel_configuring <dataset_size>\ntraining_started <dataset_size>\ntraining_progress <iteration> [loss]\nloss <value>\ntraining_done\ntraining_error <error_code>\nevent <event_name> [values]\nerror <error_code>\n\nSends structured state, progress and error messages to driftmap_ui.js."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-116",
                                    "linecount": 26,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 1841.935497045517, 325.80645394325256, 150.0, 355.0 ],
                                    "text": "INPUT 3 — MAX FEEDBACK\n\nMessages:\npreset_ready <pattern_id>\ndataset_cleared\ntraining_started\ntraining_progress <iteration> [loss]\nloss <value>\ntraining_done\ntraining_error <error_code>\nbank_ready\n\npreset_ready 1\nend_of_bank 12\ndataset_cleared\nmodel_reset_done\nmlp_config_applied 4\nfit_result 1 0.034\nfit_error 1 error_code\n\nReceives confirmations from presets, datasets and model training."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-112",
                                    "linecount": 13,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 1667.7419474124908, 325.80645394325256, 153.0, 181.0 ],
                                    "text": "INPUT 2 — LIVE POSITION\n\nList:\n<xL> <yL> <xR> <yR>\n\nExample:\n0.228346 0.496063 0.496063 0.496063\n\nReceives the current four-dimensional controller position."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-109",
