                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 1500.000010728836, 332.2580668926239, 150.0, 623.0 ],
                                    "text": "INPUT 1 — CONTROLLER COMMANDS\n\nMessages:\nreset\nclear_dataset\ndebug 0/1\nseed <integer>\nspread <0.0–1.0>\nautofit 0/1\nreduce_motion 0/1\nmode auto/semi/free/play\nstart_questionnaire\nrestart_questionnaire\nlike\ndislike\nreplay_pattern\nauto_points <count>\nselect_pattern <1–12>\nbatch_points <count>\nmap_here\nadd_point\ntrain\nrequest_new_bank\n\nmode auto\nmode semi\nmode free\nstart_questionnaire\nlike\ndislike\ncancel_questionnaire\ntrain\ntrain_from_scratch\ncontinue_training\nstop_training\nreset_model\nmodelbypass 0\nmodelbypass 1\nmlp_hiddenlayers 3 3\nmlp_maxiter 50\n...\n\nReceives all commands from the JSUI or Max."
                                }
